Subject: Derived CPMS I03D Independent Schema and Typed Reader Observation Source

Description: Manager-derived source preserving the exact two-reader observation contract that follows faithful byte ingress and residual registry formation. It defines independent Draft 2020-12 schema and actual Rust serde observations without collapsing syntax, representation, semantics, or authority. Formation grants no validator, parser, reader, corpus, or runtime implementation authority.

